# === Environment & Secrets ===
# .env files contain API keys and must never be committed.
# Use .env.example / data/setup.env.example as templates (tracked).
# User-local secrets from `zavorth setup interactive` live under state dir
# (e.g. $ZAVORTH_HOME/state/setup.local.env) — also ignore any stray copies.
.env
**/.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test
.env.staging
**/setup.local.env
setup.local.env
data/setup.local.env
config/AIGateway-overlay.json

